From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:45:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: delegate direct MP4 transfers to the system during
 screen-off

Recover provider-owned transfers after process or worker replacement, verify the local video before saving, and keep private, multi-track and streaming inputs on their existing transport. Handoffs and gallery visibility use the normal offline queue.
